      "chapterUid": 3,
      "range": "1272-1301",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "让你的风险变大的绝对不是创业，而是你的无知、傲慢和不学习！",
      "totalCount": 3370
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25403958",
      "userVid": 307505427,
      "bookmarkId": "25403958_34_1680-1763",
      "chapterUid": 34,
      "range": "1680-1763",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "创业的第一步在于你想为这个社会解决什么问题，而不在于你会什么，有哪方面的能力。即便你什么都不会，只要能找到一个又大又痛的问题，努力去学习、去提升自我，你就都能学得会。",
      "totalCount": 2580
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25403958",
      "userVid": 303659984,
      "bookmarkId": "25403958_38_5601-5645",
      "chapterUid": 38,
      "range": "5601-5645",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "承认自己落后没关系，因为最重要的事情是成长，是你有没有每天都在进步，这是美德背后的美德。",
      "totalCount": 2430
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25403958",
      "userVid": 268303050,
      "bookmarkId": "25403958_5_1773-1792",
      "chapterUid": 5,
      "range": "1773-1792",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "做企业最重要的是现金流，而不是净资产。",
      "totalCount": 2310
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25403958",
      "userVid": 32105987,
      "bookmarkId": "25403958_18_671-739",
      "chapterUid": 18,
      "range": "671-739",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "什么是秘密？你能做，别人即便知道了也做不了，或者就算做出来，也跟你的不一样，这就是秘密。",
      "totalCount": 2244
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25403958",
      "userVid": 269744401,
      "bookmarkId": "25403958_6_2900-2920",
      "chapterUid": 6,
      "range": "2900-2920",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "性格好的人，创业的结果往往坏不到哪儿去。",
      "totalCount": 1674
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25403958",
      "userVid": 393226761,
      "bookmarkId": "25403958_23_3577-3596",
      "chapterUid": 23,
      "range": "3577-3596",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "请记住，验证的最好方法是卖，而不是问。",
      "totalCount": 1530
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25403958",
      "userVid": 11232670,
      "bookmarkId": "25403958_8_2969-3023",
      "chapterUid": 8,
      "range": "2969-3023",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "当某项发明仅仅是为了展示创业者的聪明才智，而非以社会存在的问题为出发点，这种创业在大部分情况下会以失败告终。",
      "totalCount": 1395
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25403958",
      "userVid": 35126416,
      "bookmarkId": "25403958_7_2404-2492",
      "chapterUid": 7,
      "range": "2404-2492",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "经营的本质就是遇到矛盾，然后解决矛盾。所有伟大的创新都是完成不可能的使命，在不可能之河上架起一座桥。”创业者最重要的力量就在于正视矛盾、解决矛盾，而不仅仅是发现。",
      "totalCount": 1350
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25403958",
      "userVid": 73416168,
      "bookmarkId": "25403958_9_2157-2168",
      "chapterUid": 9,
      "range": "2157-2168",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "把创业视为人生的修炼。",
      "totalCount": 1344
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25403958",
      "userVid": 206049748,
      "bookmarkId": "25403958_11_2955-2998",
      "chapterUid": 11,
      "range": "2955-2998",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "现在开始，仔细倾听身边那些抱怨的声音，从这些声音中找到客户真正需要的点，然后着手解决。",
      "totalCount": 1290
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25403958",
      "userVid": 30142596,
      "bookmarkId": "25403958_12_4847-4904",
      "chapterUid": 12,
      "range": "4847-4904",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "要想真正洞察低风险创业的机会，创业者必须进入客户的生活，跟他的灵魂融为一体，从他的角度来看待这个问题应该如何解决。",
      "totalCount": 1222
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25403958",
      "userVid": 37109265,
      "bookmarkId": "25403958_9_662-716",
      "chapterUid": 9,
      "range": "662-716",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "“你的潜意识指引着你的人生，而你称其为命运。”",
      "totalCount": 1207
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25403958",
      "userVid": 32105987,
      "bookmarkId": "25403958_8_729-827",
      "chapterUid": 8,
      "range": "729-827",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "为什么发明人创业风险很大？因为他爱的不是他要去解决的社会问题，而是他的发明。一旦遇到问题，他想的不是最好的解决方案，而是不管如何，我就是要将我的发明推广到世界的每一个角落，即便撞到南墙我也不回头。",
      "totalCount": 1196
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25403958",
      "userVid": 278331892,
      "bookmarkId": "25403958_5_4825-4859",
      "chapterUid": 5,
      "range": "4825-4859",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "每个人都有着自己的认知局限，我们必须理解父母在认知局限下做出的选择。",
      "totalCount": 1139
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25403958",
      "userVid": 289152207,
      "bookmarkId": "25403958_31_2077-2099",
      "chapterUid": 31,
      "range": "2077-2099",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "创业最痛苦的事莫过于只把事业当做谋生的工具。",
      "totalCount": 1054
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25403958",
      "userVid": 41595026,
      "bookmarkId": "25403958_9_2707-2762",
      "chapterUid": 9,
      "range": "2707-2762",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "一旦你能将创业视为人生修炼的过程，你会发现，创业这件事本身就是一件令人愉快的事情，不赚钱才是你修炼最快的时候。",
      "totalCount": 1027
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25403958",
      "userVid": 408114661,
      "bookmarkId": "25403958_28_4282-4321",
      "chapterUid": 28,
      "range": "4282-4321",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "反脆弱的商业结构，其实就是将失败的成本控制在最低限度，同时不断放大收益的上限。",
      "totalCount": 1020
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25403958",
      "userVid": 1226782,
      "bookmarkId": "25403958_39_2854-2921",
      "chapterUid": 39,
      "range": "2854-2921",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "创业者需要跟员工和代理商共同承担错误，仅仅允许员工犯错还不够，在员工犯错的时候，你还要跟他共同承担错误带来的后果，这才是生物态的思维。",
      "totalCount": 1008
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25403958",
      "userVid": 208993186,
      "bookmarkId": "25403958_56_3096-3112",
      "chapterUid": 56,
      "range": "3096-3112",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "唯一限制我们的，是我们的想象力。",
      "totalCount": 984
    }
